1.0.1 2026-10-22
  - Add 2 unambiguous source-label alias encodings using existing category keys/definitions;
    retain every original definition and all participant/electrode table bytes. No new clinical
    meaning or data recoding. Exact original schema retained in sourcedata/enumeration-alias-originals.tar.gz.
  - Remove 1 empty Levels enumerations from participants.json; no defined categories
    or participant table values change. Exact source schema retained under
    sourcedata/participant-schema-before-empty-enum-fix/participants.json.
  - 2026-10-19 electrode locations: add coordsystem.json MNI305/mm next to 16 electrodes.tsv (16 files). README: section 'Electrode locations (19 Oct 2026)'.
  - channels.tsv of 16 recordings = the data-file header channel list (name, order, count; matched by name): 990 rows renamed to the header name, 0 rows added, 990 rows removed (kept in sourcedata/channels-removed-2026-10-18/), 16 files reordered. Before, mne_bids could not apply channels.tsv to these files (count or name mismatch).
  - README: section 'Channel names follow the data headers'.

